Package: fcitx5-vnkey
Architecture: any
Depends: libfcitx5core7, libfcitx5config6, libfcitx5utils2, libstdc++6, libc6
Recommends: fcitx5
Description: Vietnamese input method for fcitx5, Rust engine
 A Vietnamese input-method engine written in Rust, wrapped in a small fcitx5
 addon. Supports the Telex, Telex 2, Telex W, VNI, VIQR and Microsoft layouts,
 sixteen legacy output charsets, macros, an embedded spell-check dictionary,
 and a daemon-wide Vietnamese/English mode toggle.
